                              "doc": "CloudEvents attribute declarations, adding constraints to the CloudEvents envelope not yet covered by the CloudEvents spec https://github.com/cloudevents/spec/blob/main/cloudevents/spec.md This declaration object is opaque to the Core attribute walker so literal null value constraints and protocol-defined property names are preserved. Message domain property-definition validation and defaults remain mandatory.",
